{"title":"Drowned Crewman","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level — Unclassified that attacks with unknown (unknown).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: Captured live by the research collector; no matching static client definition was in the bundled database.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 3 recorded drops, 96 total, 31–34 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×31–34</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 3 of 3 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 4 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-kryss\" title=\"Silver Kryss - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bones\" title=\"Bones - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bones</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Unclassified: <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-captain\">Captain Corva Redmaw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(—)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-marksman\">Marksman Pell</a> <span class=\"muted\">(—)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-bosun\">Bosun Grell</a> <span class=\"muted\">(—)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/cc5e71b742242546145d.svg\" alt=\"Drowned Crewman\"></div><h3>Drowned Crewman</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>— <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–15)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Unclassified</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>unknown · unknown</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>—</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack range</th><td>—</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}